  "style": "",
  "text": "In the present study, we found that anlotinib enhanced radiosensitivity in vitro and in vivo. Also, the addition of anlotinib to RT increased the infiltration and activation of IR-stimulated CD8+ T cells via activating cGAS/STING signaling. Next, we assessed the synergistic effects of combining anlotinib with RT and anti-PD-L1 and observed that triple therapy attenuated CD8+ T cell exhaustion, promoted the cytotoxicity and proliferation of CD8+ T cells, and boosted immune memory activation, while the addition of STING inhibitor weakened the trend."
}

